{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "647d83d861ffaa64135d739d8aca4ee38bc36afba204cd69f151f51308668b8e", "ja": "（今日は、ホワイトデーキャンペーンのポスター撮り。\n撮影は順調に進み、今は休憩中なのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是白色情人节活动的海报拍摄。拍摄进展得很顺利，现在正在休息，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "3c7953d51083d7b492ca21aedc100f75d4882c6a7507797241ce28c25d29490b", "ja": "う～ん、ホワイトデーか……\nお返しどうしようかな。", "zh": "嗯～白色情人节啊……\n该回送什么好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "67a5fca2b8198f521332678fef4bbae4089e400519be1f479effac9cd2cd62c1", "ja": "のり子、お疲れさま。\nお返しって、ホワイトデーのか？", "zh": "典子，辛苦了。\n你说的回礼，是指白色情人节吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "05122cf8b6ab0d7801198f35f48ba5a73b0ee21af4f55e1e41a27f8a7fb73159", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ！\nそうなんだ。大学の友達に、友チョコもらっちゃって。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦！\n是这样的，我从大学朋友那里收到了友情巧克力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "380e75e7bde9dc2e20e8fb266e25d53223ff93ec0076f5e7651551f5b40c1580", "ja": "だからアタシもお返ししたいんだけど、\n何がいいかなぁって……。", "zh": "所以我也想回礼，可是该送什么好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1005_043nor", "source_sha256": "2d583cbe75ac3ab9cfc9f75606335158713489e1cb8c4fe7d11e62c08f9ae3fb", "ja": "{$P$}もさ、劇場のみんなから\nもらうでしょ？　お返し、悩んだりしない？", "zh": "{$P$}也是，会收到剧场大家送的礼物吧？你也会烦恼该回送什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1006_p", "source_sha256": "10b52ab9132d4399088cf9d3a1805a2cb3da08047fcf1e5a4ea0ad7fb796533f", "ja": "そうだな……好みもあるから、\n相手によって変えたりはしてるけど。", "zh": "是啊……毕竟每个人的喜好不同，所以我会根据对象做些调整。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "4e742adac760c2d3b4c62bac93ae4b3cc6a12acbf70e8bdd7e7140331d762e3b", "ja": "やっぱり、そうなんだ。\nうーん、お返しってけっこう難しいよね。", "zh": "果然是这样啊。\n嗯——回礼还真是挺难的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1008_p", "source_sha256": "29eae3d68a0ea3d10bb531d254ef0ae5e31efb5956b847812b27f09a74004413", "ja": "そんなに難しく考えなくても……\n自分が欲しいものじゃダメなのか？", "zh": "不用想得那么复杂……\n送自己想要的东西不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "7a1d2ab3f7871d27e1ae443f59755318b1096e322876b17d450dde173b8d5922", "ja": "自分が欲しいもの？", "zh": "自己想要的东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6aead6a2941a139e772add1719107bf39d3004a1dc243642cc8c6c419346c2da", "ja": "うん。たとえば……\nのり子だったら、今、何が欲しい？", "zh": "嗯。比如说……\n如果是你，现在想要什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "2d16c743a0c4e942ef95273d1d1898755349c4ad4a459b6d1af90d08cbfbde71", "ja": "アタシだったら……あっ！\nでも、うう……。", "zh": "要是我的话……啊！\n可是，呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9ca3d3986c86c14836a3848c761c8a5746763ca19703eed0b7b7bdf34d6d9986", "ja": "今ののり子が欲しいものでいいんだよ。\n遠慮しないで、思いついた事を言ってみてくれ。", "zh": "现在你想要的东西就行。\n别客气，说说你想到的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "7bbbcf27ca7fe7a0676d0915471a3b36ba0d8adc58a001c7c41875e32a413e60", "ja": "{$P$}……う、うん。\nえっと、今アタシが欲しいのは……お、お花、かな？", "zh": "{$P$}……嗯、嗯。\n那个，我现在想要的是……花、花吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "d23d2d33d928433f22f591e4ffc9d278070e1ebc1ca3ec2c973ac2a8c7df6ad7", "ja": "ほ、ほら！　ポスターの撮影で、ずっとバラの花に\n囲まれてたでしょ？　そういうの、なんか新鮮で……。", "zh": "你、你看！拍海报的时候，一直被玫瑰花围在中间吧？那种感觉，怎么说呢，特别新鲜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1015_043nor", "source_sha256": "722fcf07cabaa01448c2836b6ddc6818886751d3d4aafd30b2dc01df39519c9c", "ja": "綺麗だし、いい香りがするし。\nお花っていいなぁって……。", "zh": "又漂亮，又香喷喷的。花儿真好啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1016_p", "source_sha256": "d20c79ba1ac0837096f907c7b7a7157451ff6a441527d29c11dedfedbc45e71b", "ja": "花、いいんじゃないか？\n相手の子に、どんな花が好きか聞いてみるといいよ。", "zh": "花挺好的吧？可以问问对方喜欢什么花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "822d7a0dca0aee91c66ac851b2ae84b943230afdafc9fe6131abab571cc1d294", "ja": "うん！　ありがと、{$P$}！\nいろいろ参考になったよ♪", "zh": "嗯！谢谢你，{$P$}！  \n我学到了很多♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1018_p", "source_sha256": "dd376f84b29bc4530ff00927c3e2cf6f873a39cbc02ca82a960384174d2b3658", "ja": "どういたしまして。撮影が終わったら、\nプレゼントの参考に、花屋さんに寄って帰ろうか？", "zh": "不客气。拍摄结束后，要不要去花店看看，顺便为挑选礼物作参考？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "d9622fad5583c597fbb37535fb42b1a6aaa6c8908820e1252b980d05b95def3b", "ja": "えっ、いいの！？　ありがとー！\nそれじゃ、がんばって撮影終わらせてくる！", "zh": "诶，可以吗！？谢谢你——！\n那我这就努力拍完回来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0154_1020_p", "source_sha256": "25e6a496c47deb93cb72c02ecbcc8bf4e4a3a773767b55d3b4eb427d0250fa92", "ja": "（のり子はそう言うと笑顔で撮影に戻っていった。\n一生懸命考えたお返し、喜んでもらえるといいな！）", "zh": "（法子说完便笑着回到拍摄现场去了。\n希望她能喜欢我用心想出来的回礼！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
